# 5️⃣ Important Optimization

```java
if(n < 4 || n > 12) return res;
```

Reason:

IP address has **4 parts**.

Each part can have **1–3 digits**.

So total digits must be:

```
minimum = 4
maximum = 12
```

If not in this range → **no valid IP possible**.

