```

Why?

We must ensure **fourth part length is between 1 and 3**.

Fourth part length:

```
n - (i+j+k)
```

So it must satisfy:

```
1 ≤ n-(i+j+k) ≤ 3
```

That is equivalent to:

```
i+j+k < n
i+j+k+3 >= n
```

